<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>LLVM Optimization Passes</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our AwareCompiler framework and baseline models operate within an action space comprising 124 individual LLVM 10.0.0 <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">opt</span> transformation passes, resulting in a total of 125 distinct actions available to the optimization agent. Table <a href="#A3.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix C LLVM Optimization Passes ‣ AwareCompiler: Agentic Context-Aware Compiler Optimization via a Synergistic Knowledge-Data Driven Framework" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> enumerates these passes and the <span id="A3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">-Oz</span> along with their corresponding indices used within our system. These flags can typically be obtained from the CompilerGym LLVM environment.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>List of Utilized LLVM Compiler Passes and <span id="A3.T4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">-Oz</span> with Corresponding Indices.</figcaption>
