<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>The Use of Large Language Models</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We used LLMs to assist in refining the clarity and coherence of the writing in the paper. The LLMs were specifically employed to improve phrasing, ensure academic rigor, and enhance overall readability. Their contribution was strictly in the writing process, and all content was thoroughly reviewed and finalized by the authors.</p>
</div>
